{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518380/extras/About_Game_.png?t=1747172473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Myth of Lumi is a 3D physics-based turf war game where you duel rival magicians in  card throwing showdowns. Set in the underground utopian city of Prospera, play as Luce, an ambitious street performer striving to join the legendary Conclave\u2014an elite circle of top-tier magicians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit Lumis, mystical creatures bound within your playing cards, to aid you in battles and carve your path to fame and fortune. Master your skills, outwit your opponents, and rise to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518380/extras/Mechanics.png?t=1747172473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THROW PLAYING CARDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect your craft by adjusting your card throwing technique, Cover the most ground with your cards to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518380/extras/Throw-Card.gif?t=1747172473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLEASH YOUR MAGIC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock more Lumis as you play. Harness the unique magical abilities of each Lumi to stack the deck in your favor. Chain multiple skills together to optimize your deck synergy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518380/extras/Unleash-Magic.gif?t=1747172473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>YOUR DESTINY AWAITS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rise through the ranks of Prospera's legendary magicians through dazzling displays of magic and high-stakes trials. Will you prove your worth or will your name be lost in the shuffle? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518380/extras/Rise-Fame.gif?t=1747172473\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518380?t=1747172473","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518380?t=1747172473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518380/b0d1e0de3535e6d7aab1ecec28fd0d03182faa1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747172473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518380/b0d1e0de3535e6d7aab1ecec28fd0d03182faa1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747172473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518380/extras/About_Game_.png?t=1747172473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Myth of Lumi is a 3D physics-based turf war game where you duel rival magicians in  card throwing showdowns. Set in the underground utopian city of Prospera, play as Luce, an ambitious street performer striving to join the legendary Conclave\u2014an elite circle of top-tier magicians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit Lumis, mystical creatures bound within your playing cards, to aid you in battles and carve your path to fame and fortune. Master your skills, outwit your opponents, and rise to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518380/extras/Mechanics.png?t=1747172473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THROW PLAYING CARDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect your craft by adjusting your card